  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support  to SNV - Netherlands Development Organisaion&apos;s project Opportunities for Youth Employment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the project is to improved livelihoods and future prospects for youth in rural areas in Singida and Morogoro, Tanzania. The specific objectives of OYE II project will be to: 
1.	Improve the employability of 4,250 youth and to ensure that at least 3,825 youth access gainful and sustainable (self)-employment and catalyse benefits for 15,300 indirect beneficiaries.
2.	Contribute towards improving youth-inclusive market-system (ecosystem) development for enhanced youth employability and employment opportunities. This involves enhancing access to finance, land, inputs, extension services, and formal and informal markets. 
3.	Drive learning and knowledge development and disseminate to stakeholders including Local Government Authorities (LGA).</narrative>
  </description>
